OL,3,GNEWSANew #38m jail wing adds 10 cells -
OL,4,Anot promised 170
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new prison wing that was meant to
OL,7,Fprovide 170 extra cells has only added
OL,8,F10 because two other wings have had to
OL,9,Fbe closed for it to be staffed, an
OL,10,Fofficer said.
OL,12,FThe #38m renovation of the Elizabeth
OL,13,FFry wing at HMP Norwich began in 2023,
OL,14,Fwhich included plans to deliver 170 new
OL,15,Fcells by 2025.
OL,17,FSteven Searby, the head of the Prison
OL,18,FOfficers Association at HMP Norwich,
OL,19,Fsaid without the extra staff that had
OL,20,Fbeen promised with the new wing, two
OL,21,Fexisting wings were forced to shut so
OL,22,Fofficers could be redeployed.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
